WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.170
Welcome to the bad beat hotline.

2
00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:05.160
Your bad beat is very important…

3
00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:05.570
…to you.

4
00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:07.050
Please continue holding.

5
00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:08.850
You were ahead on the flop?

6
00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:10.150
Fascinating.

7
00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:11.850
I will alert the authorities.

8
00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:14.530
You’ve got fifteen minutes
for that story.

9
00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:17.530
Give The Commish five seconds
for an RSVP.

10
00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:19.150
Open the yellow chip.

11
00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:20.250
Choose your name.

12
00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:21.250
Tap In,

13
00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:21.950
Maybe,

14
00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:22.590
or Out.

15
00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:25.250
It’s TLPT RSVP.

16
00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:27.150
Sympathy sold separately.
